linhas.pt:
#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, por favor, volte.
Você acumulou muita fadiga;
continuar será perigoso!

linhas.en:
With her hands, meant to touch things, as grotesque claws;
with skin as frail as light snowfall to the touch,
it's difficult to socialize with others.
